  "interpretation": "Earlier product-review escalation was premature: the failing route sent one final position, while the agreed TUI policy interpolates and reports committed cell changes. Preserve the one-shot failure as a diagnostic limitation, not proof that ordinary interpolation fails. Physics residency uses the first sphere center, so cell-ID equality at every body-reference-position boundary sample is not a general correctness invariant."
